Z||000000||Gumball||05-18-2001||09:21 PM||||Have any of you guys draged raced anyone in a rolling start. (roll at 10mph then gun it) It is awsome with the 4spd manual.<P>Last weekend at the illegal drags, i did a roll start challenge with 3 other cars at once.  A 5.0 Mudstain, Eclips Turbo, and a Integra GSR  The road was a 4 lane one way and the challenge was for only a block(about 1/10 of a mile).  Too my suprise i came up on top.<BR>What these guys did not know was that i was rolling on second gear    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>If the track was any longer they would have handed my a$$ on a platter.     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"><BR>They thought i had a small block in my Fiero, 86 2M6.  I poped up the trunk to the guys request and when they saw the bone stock 2.8, they all scratched their heads.  No one couldnt figure out that i was rolling on second.  <BR>This weekend i gonna go scrach some more heads.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"><BR>------------------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1689731&a=12969660&p=48727113&Sequence=0&res=high"> <BR>Don't mess with the best!<p>[This message has been edited by Gumball (edited 05-18-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||88formula||05-18-2001||09:28 PM||||*************************************************************<BR>I take that back<BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/88formula_logo_1.JPG">  <p>[This message has been edited by 88formula (edited 05-19-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000002||cadaver||05-19-2001||03:13 PM||||I enjoy the launch. I used to race mustangs. YES I OWN MUSTANGS AND  IT SUCKS WHEN YOU GUYS DIS THEM. Any way I have a 67 with a 351 and a 4 speed. I can launch it with the best of them. And a front engine rear wheel drive car will always get a holeshot on anything front wheel drive. They just cant hook up.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Shaun41178||05-20-2001||10:26 PM||||I have done rolling starts before.  Most of the time around 40-45 mph though as that is the speed limit here and it is just randomly done when you can find a willing participant.  I would usually come out on top with my auto tranny till about 75 and depending on the car I would start to fade after that.  This is with my nitrous of course.  I prefer racing from lights as that is my cars strong point and always hooks good off the line.  I beat a conquest by 1 car out of the hole and after the race was over he couldn't believe how bad I got him off the line and said that he whoops on this SN-95 Cobra all the time and the Cobra has some suspension mods.  SO I was pretty happy when he told me that.  <P>By the way Good Kills!<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
